=2 Enemies
|^Level|Name|Zone|Aggro|Link|Drops|Steal|Spawns
|?|Vulcanian Bomb|{p:Lebros Cavern}|Yes|No||None|7

=3 Notes
* Vulcanian Bombs cast Fire-based magic of the appropriate level.
* Vulcanian Bombs aggro sight and magic. They can be avoided with {p:Invisible (Status)}.
** Apkallus will continue to follow you while you are {p:Invisible|Invisible (Status)}.

=2 Walkthrough
Match the male {n:Lebros Apkallu} up to the female {n:Lebros Apkallu}. You only need to match up one pair to win, but for every pair less than 8 you will recieve reduced points.
* The apkallus in this assault speak in morse code. And you thought they were annoying in {p:Apkallu Seizure}!

:* Squee = dot, Quark = dash.

* To match up apkallus you will have to take a male from the west to females in the east.
* The male apkallus will follow you a little faster than walking speed.
* If you get too far ahead of the male apkallus they will stop moving. To start them following you again simply move back in to range of them.
* The females will spawn in the same area every time, see map.
* The pairs are as follows

:* Blue - Sky
:* Cod - Fish
:* Heat - Fire
:* Moon - Star
:* Orange - Apple
:* Rain - Cloud
:* Snow - White
:* Song - Sound

* The mission is completed upon speaking to {n:Rhap Nelhah} and choosing to finish.
** Alternatively, if all 8 matches are made, the mission will complete automatically.
* The {p:Rune of Release} spawns at the starting NPC, {n:Rhap Nelhah}.
* The map below is awesome. Use it.

